cases reach a body not made yet: `Propagate`, at
probe_propagate_in_generic/src/main.av.through_plain". With only the
`bound_first` case (bind the Result with its type, then `?`) the suite
passes, so the gap is `let s: Seven = b.as_made()?` — `?` whose operand's
type parameter is pinned by the annotation on the other side of the `?`.
Generic or plain outer fn alike.

Wanted: `let idea: Idea = req.body_as()?` — the handler's first line in
std-http's typed reads. Until then a handler binds the Result first:
